    "text": "Lynda Joiner wins female 65-and-over division at Tiskilwa Pow Wow 5K in Tiskilwa on Aug. 1, 2026\nTiskilwa Pow Wow 5K 2026 Run/Walk in Tiskilwa, Illinois, on Aug. 1, 2026, saw Lynda Joiner win the female 65-and-over division with a finish time of 34:17.6; she placed 46th overall. Full results are available at the RunSignUp results.\nHer hometown was listed as Tiskilwa, Illinois.",
